"{\n  \"reasoning\": \"Chosen gm\u2248250\u00b5S to meet 20\u202fMHz GBW with CL=2\u202fpF. Tail current Itail\u224850\u202f\u00b5A gives Id per input \u224825\u202f\u00b5A, power 3.3\u202fV\u00b7100\u202f\u00b5A\u2248330\u202f\u00b5W <400\u202f\u00b5W. To obtain \u226540\u202fdB gain, set L=1\u202f\u00b5m for M1\u2011M4, reducing channel\u2011length\u2011modulation and giving gds\u22480.7\u20111.4\u202f\u00b5S, yielding gain \u2248120 (>100). Vov\u22480.2\u202fV for input pair and load gives sufficient swing (\u22482.6\u202fV). Tail device uses Vov\u22480.3\u202fV for robustness. All dimensions are rounded to practical values.\",\n  \"W1_um\": 6.3,\n  \"L1_um\": 1.0,\n  \"W3_um\": 12.5,\n  \"L3_um\": 1.0,\n  \"W5_um\": 2.8,\n  \"L5_um\": 0.5,\n  \"Itail_uA\": 50.0\n}"